<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-29T02:40:01.832Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:40:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab fighters are intensifying attacks on Somali army units, including a convoy ambush near Baidoa and a mortar strike in Puntland that killed three civilians and wounded seven. The army advanced on Burhakabo and engaged in heavy fighting near Buurhakaba district, reporting the death of a former Al-Shabaab finance chief and claiming 75 militants killed. Somalia denied that Turkish F-16 aircraft struck its own positions during the clashes. Former president Farmaajo called for an independent probe into the fighting in Jamea. The conflict has resulted in 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE40U2xka1ZmVW04THNGQXczdTJyQ0M4MV9tVXJnenZ3c1VRUlV0dWt1a3Z0cFp0dTF2Wml2QVhMRkVMZE1hVzhDTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPOUxJOVFBa0FLeVdfTkRsZHMwVlhBU2FJU2xPeHVGTks4aUdQbjdEYlZQR0RNU1lTdHMtNHFPcjQ2OV92VkN5LWRVblk4aTdxQ1RVbFdKX0hkTHVxd1VnRVhEZnR2bTU5clh5U2JhWS1xOXRnTGdzemFHNWFLMU51UlJkM1JLMUt2YmtCUkZDVFU4X05WSHZBb3ZVeEZVbFZqb1NNdDF2Um1JaW5Pbk9UYWRpRXY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNOTZuZ0dONjRBS29aVXUyNU5KVVFRYUxVSjJucERaRUE4Uk82YlZYZFEtd0ZUempSZXB0VGxrMmpGRE1XZDNMUk5rQnVaOE9nNnJyQ3Z1LVVYM1d6Z3RjTVJaSDlNVnRNYVdlWmo0UURoalIyaFAxVG1yVVZHdXdtbTYyb0F3V0NUbWNseUlzMHVFSDQtSFNfdVkxeFN0RmJnVFNIYUdvLXQ3ay12U2EwTHE5V0EyT3Y4bHlMR2s3UDFTVE1z?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNWFM0Z1oyeFpQZ1MwSFEtUDNPV3NLajVoZjhfUlBKNHRrczduMUwzU2VsOHo0ZHAwWVFXV084RWhXR1dIOUNLVGc1N3dGSnd1S1lidmZJaTFSLVVWMzNLUTItbWNpcUQta21BWm1xY0ZqUmYwVXZoQnh2OFdWRk5XaGU0VHVvd2hyeUVPNnlSZFlQWUx2NG9rRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Geeska&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.googl